{"articleNo":"499412","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=499412&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] 도서관 보존서고 자료정리 작업기간 중 보존서고 자료 대출 중지 안내(10/21~)","writer":"도서관","writeDate":"2024.10.02","hit":"16140","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-left:20px; margin-right:7px; text-indent:-14.7pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 14pt;\">도서관 보존서고의 자료 관리 방법 개선을 위한 정리 작업 실시를 위해 해당 작업기간 중 다음과 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">같이 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">보존서고 자료</span></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 14pt;\">의 </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">대출</span></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 14pt;\">을 </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">중지</span></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 14pt;\">하오니</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:20px; margin-right:7px; text-indent:-14.7pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 14pt;\">도서관 자료 이용에 참고하여 주시기 바랍니다</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:20px; margin-right:7px; text-indent:-14.7pt\" class=\"0\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-right:7px\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">□ </span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">대출 중지 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: 2024.10.21.(</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)~12.31(</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-right:7px\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">대출 중지 기간은 작업 상황에 따라 변동 될 수 있음</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-right:7px\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">□ </span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">대출 중지 대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">보존서고 자료 약 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">170,000</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">권</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-right:7px\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">도서관 홈페이지 자료 검색 시 해당 자료의 소장위치가 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">‘</span></strong></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">보존서고</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">-1</span></strong></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">층</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">’</span></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">인 자료</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
